      "id": 140803,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-22T17:07:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My favorite is Legacy, Tempest, Scholar, Expat. &nbsp;Although the key is Tempest-&gt;Scholar.</p><p>Get 2 reclaims, and 2 DDA (one of each can be in the trash).</p><p>Then you cycle them, reclaim to put a card on top, DDA to put those into play, as long as Scholar and Tempest keep putting their second copy on top you do it every round.</p><p>Take Down and Unload played out of turn each round is wicked, but any hero with great one-shots works. &nbsp;Adept can get really crazy with flare and shadow, but mostly it gets impossible to figure out what is going on.</p><p>Unity's automated Golem construction system is spectacularly broken.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:17:46.723Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
