      "created_at": "2015-04-22T23:26:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We had Tempest with two copies of Reclaim in hand at once and Tachyon with both Lightspeed Barrages. Tempest spent the whole game Reclaiming Reclaim from the Deep from the deep, allowing Tachyon to keep playing Lightspeed Barrages every round. Meanwhile, Haka spent the rest of the game Ground Pounding until Tachyon had killed everything.</p>",
